@HostAddress = https://localhost:7072

### 1. Anonymous Read (Allowed - 200 OK)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/products?page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Anonymous Product Mutation (Denied - 401 Unauthorized with WWW-Authenticate: Bearer header)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Anonymous Product",
  "sku": "ANON-001",
  "description": "Attempt to create product without auth token",
  "price": 999.99,
  "availableQuantity": 10
}

###

### 3. Register Customer Account (201 Created)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "userName": "customer_demo",
  "email": "customer@example.com",
  "password": "CustomerPass123!"
}

###

### 4. Login as Customer (200 OK -> returns accessToken)
# @name customerLogin
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "userName": "customer_demo",
  "password": "CustomerPass123!"
}

###

@customerToken = {{customerLogin.response.body.accessToken}}

### 5. Customer Product Mutation (Denied - 403 Forbidden)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Customer Product",
  "sku": "CUST-001",
  "description": "Attempt to create product with Customer role token",
  "price": 49.99,
  "availableQuantity": 5
}

###

### 6. Login as Development Admin (200 OK -> returns accessToken)
# Password must match the value configured in User Secrets: dotnet user-secrets set "SeedAdmin:Password" "..."
# @name adminLogin
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "userName": "admin",
  "password": "AdminPassword123!"
}

###

@adminToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.accessToken}}

### 7. Admin Product Mutation (Success - 201 Created)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Admin Pro Laptop",
  "sku": "ADM-PRO-001",
  "description": "Successfully created by Admin user",
  "price": 1499.99,
  "availableQuantity": 50
}

###

### 8. CORS Preflight - Valid Origin (Allowed - Returns 204/200 with Access-Control-Allow-Origin: http://localhost:4200)
OPTIONS {{HostAddress}}/api/products
Origin: http://localhost:4200
Access-Control-Request-Method: POST
Access-Control-Request-Headers: authorization,content-type

###

### 9. CORS Preflight - Untrusted Origin (Denied - No Access-Control-Allow-Origin returned)
OPTIONS {{HostAddress}}/api/products
Origin: http://malicious-site.com
Access-Control-Request-Method: POST
Access-Control-Request-Headers: authorization,content-type

###

### 10. Rate Limiting on Login - Send rapid consecutive requests to trigger 429 Too Many Requests
# Permit limit: 5 requests per 1-minute window per IP. The 6th request returns 429.
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "userName": "admin",
  "password": "WrongPasswordAttempt"
}

###
